changes; another adapter must establish its own state sufficiency.
Active-dependency collection bounds protocol entries relative
to live references, separately from cumulative text, current
state, and total memory. Owner/worker recovery assumes the
surviving services of Section II. Replaying old facts restores
access to that prefix; the measured cold Owner restarts still
miss original deadlines for new work. Broader ownership
transfer requires separate validation. Finite specifications,
source controls, controlled faults, actual GPU service, and
retrospective checks provide distinct evidence.
      d) Eligibility and resource admission: A valid input
witness determines whether an owned call may be used. It
does not determine whether starting another conditional call
is worthwhile. Limiting new speculation can leave existing
supported whole views intact. The long stress study motivates
this separate resource decision. In a bounded two-client probe,
new speculative calls precede another client’s ready necessary
call in both repeats. The later client has no additional C8 misses,
and its C99 penalty fails the predeclared repeat-consistency
gate. No admission controller or general native-session fairness
is evaluated.
